{"poe":"brief","content":"Reviewing plan from the planning agent (Plan Increment). Will check technical correctness, right-sizing, dependency completeness, protocol compliance, and must-not coverage against project artifacts."}
```

```json
{"poe":"step","name":"interface-compliance","detail":"Checking plan structure against conops.md. No Tauri commands or custom events — pure browser game. Checking plan event structure against poe protocol where applicable."}
```

```json
{"poe":"step","name":"schema-compliance","detail":"No database schema. Checking word corpus embedding approach and that no external data sources are referenced. Fully embedded JS arrays per MN-SEC-01/02."}
```

```json
{"poe":"step","name":"task-sizing","detail":"All 12 tasks are 1-2h. scoreGuess()+duplicate handling (t4, ~2h) is the most complex — bounded algorithm with known edge cases. t11 compliance audit at ~2h is tight for 16 constraints but achievable with a checklist-driven approach. No task is an undeclared epic."}
```

```json
{"poe":"step","name":"dependency-completeness","detail":"Checking 19 declared edges for completeness and cycle freedom. Noting t9 (CSS) and t6 (renderRow color class manipulation) relationship — potential missing edge if color classes live in t9 rather than t1."}
```

```json
{"poe":"step","name":"skill-assignments","detail":"frontend for t1-t9 correct. test for t10-t11 correct. senior-engineer for t12 correct. Epic e3 under senior-engineer is appropriate for a QA-scoped epic."}
```

```json
{"poe":"step","name":"coverage","detail":"Checking for missing tasks against must-nots.md enumeration. Prior review r-eng identified 16 MN identifiers vs stated 14. Confirming that count independently. Checking for missing test, migration, or integration tasks."}
```

Now writing the review artifact:

```json
{"poe":"artifact","name":"review-r-eng-2.md","artifact_type":"plan-review"}
```

```json
{"poe":"done","summary":"Review complete. Verdict: APPROVED_WITH_CONDITIONS. Confirms r-eng findings (t11 MN count off by 2, t6 description conflates textContent and classList) and adds one new WARN: missing t9→t6 dependency edge — color CSS class availability must be resolved before t6 implementation begins."}
```

